            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-EDGE-PULL-AA\"><b>Laurey Edge Pull in Anodized Aluminum</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Anodized Aluminum Edge Pull installs with a low profile that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. The Edge Pull in Anodized Aluminum can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. Choose from an array of sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Anodized Aluminum Cabinet Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Anodized Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Package with 2 Self Tap Screws - 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-96701:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96201:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96301:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96401:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96501:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
